      "start_seconds": 0.78,
      "end_seconds": 7.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.01,
      "end_seconds": 13.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.77,
      "end_seconds": 19.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Well, I've been having itchy spots all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.67,
      "end_seconds": 22.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.68,
      "end_seconds": 27.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I've had it for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.18,
      "end_seconds": 32.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.12,
      "end_seconds": 36.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.09,
      "end_seconds": 50.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.35,
      "end_seconds": 53.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.83,
      "end_seconds": 58.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.18,
      "end_seconds": 64.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "It's lansoprazole, 30 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.52,
      "end_seconds": 67.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.01,
      "end_seconds": 72.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.21,
      "end_seconds": 76.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.75,
      "end_seconds": 82.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.07,
      "end_seconds": 85.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.42,
      "end_seconds": 91.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.68,
      "end_seconds": 97.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.95,
      "end_seconds": 101.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Acid reflux, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.49,
      "end_seconds": 111.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Yes. Alright, acid reflux, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.31,
      "end_seconds": 131.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "so, any breathlessness or pregnancy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.88,
      "end_seconds": 140.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Okay, uh, so none of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.74,
      "end_seconds": 143.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Any stiff neck or being immunosuppressed?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.86,
      "end_seconds": 145.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.92,
      "end_seconds": 153.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.91,
      "end_seconds": 156.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "bowels are regular, nothing odd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.54,
      "end_seconds": 173.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "let me take your readings now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.39,
      "end_seconds": 185.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.89,
      "end_seconds": 217.49,
      "duration_seconds": 11.6,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 80 beats a minute, SpO2 99 percent on room air, respiratory rate 17, temp 36.9 degrees, BP is 118 over 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.91,
      "end_seconds": 223.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Now I'm going to to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.82,
      "end_seconds": 226.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.53,
      "end_seconds": 246.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "there are crops of blisters and scabs in different stages on the trunk"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.69,
      "end_seconds": 255.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. So where does that leave us? This is probably chickenpox."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.99,
      "end_seconds": 259.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.17,
      "end_seconds": 266.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like chickenpox."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.79,
      "end_seconds": 301.01,
      "duration_seconds": 24.22,
      "text": "I'm prescribing aciclovir, 800 milligrams, five times a day, seven days it's for adult chickenpox i'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it stay at home until all the spots have crusted and stay away from pregnant women i think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.39,
      "end_seconds": 305.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.34,
      "end_seconds": 308.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
